<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N =  2.56%			 O/N = 5.75%</p>
<p>	    T/N =  2.56%			 T/N = 5.11%</p>
<p>		   Nov 26, 1996			Nov 22, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  5.11%	1 month forward =  6.81%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  7.77%	2 month forward =  8.52%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  7.73%	3 month forward =  8.86%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  8.35%	4 month forward =  9.20%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  8.52%	5 month forward =  9.40%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  8.57%	6 month forward =  9.35%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
